        "id": "eci_16",
        "name": "Bone active treatments",
        "text": "Have received any of the following bone active treatments within the time frames specified below, or plan to receive them during the study: oral bisphosphonate use (>3 months cumulative treatment in the past 2 years, OR >1 month in the past year, OR any use during the 3 months prior to screening); administration of intravenous zoledronic acid within the last 5 years; administration of intravenous bisphosphonate (excluding zoledronic acid), fluoride, or strontium within the past 2 years; parathyroid hormone (PTH), or PTH derivative (teriparatide, abaloparatide) in the past year; or treatment with denosumab in the past year.",
